message: "If you use this code, data, or figures, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "RepFix: Silent Scale Shift — When Shared Updates Break Existing Readouts"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, per-seed result files, and run logs for the paper
  "Silent Scale Shift: When Shared Updates Break Existing Readouts". The
  repository contains the training and evaluation code, the per-table
  configuration files and seed lists, fixed-protocol audits, and recorded per-seed results. Historical aggregate-only
  exceptions and additional inputs needed for training are documented in the artifact.
